---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ComingSoon from "../components/ComingSoon.astro";
import PageTop from "../components/PageTop.astro";
import PhoneFrame from "../components/PhoneFrame.astro";
---
<Base title="Pricing | atHand" description="atHand is a free download. A one-time purchase unlocks every record type. There is no subscription.">
  <PageTop title="Pricing">
    <p class="lede">atHand is a free download. A one-time purchase unlocks full use. There is no subscription, no ads, and no account.</p>
    <ComingSoon />
    <div class="shot-panel" slot="visual">
      <PhoneFrame shot="07-paywall-perks" crop="perks" alt="The atHand unlock screen, headed “Unlock everything atHand knows.” Its list reads: add your household, vehicles, pets, homes, and more; scan documents for every record, not just yours; your information stays on this device; one purchase, no subscription, no ads, no account." />
    </div>
  </PageTop>

  <div class="container">
    <ul class="fact-row">
      <li>Free to download</li>
      <li>Your own record is free</li>
      <li>One purchase unlocks everything else</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="prose">

    <h2>Free</h2>
    <p>Without a purchase, you can:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Create, view, and edit your own record.</li>
      <li>Scan documents and attach photos to your own record.</li>
      <li>Use the app lock, appearance, and suggestion settings.</li>
      <li>Export and import backups.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>One-time purchase</h2>
    <p>The unlock adds:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Records for your household, vehicles, pets, homes, financial accounts, contacts, and custom records.</li>
      <li>Scanning documents for every record, not just yours.</li>
      <li>Opening every record, including records that arrive in a backup you import.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You pay once, and the unlock is yours to keep. The App Store shows the price in your local currency before you buy.</p>

    <h2>Your purchase and your Apple ID</h2>
    <p>A purchase belongs to the Apple ID you used to buy it. It unlocks every iPhone signed in to that Apple ID after you tap Restore purchase.</p>
    <p>Someone with a different Apple ID, such as a partner, buys separately. Family Sharing is not available for the unlock.</p>
    <p>Purchases are handled by Apple.</p>

    <h2>Backups never unlock</h2>
    <p>A backup file carries your information only, never the purchase. On a new iPhone, tap Restore purchase to unlock atHand with your Apple ID.</p>
    <p>If you import a backup without the unlock, every record in it still appears on your home screen. Your own record stays free, and opening any other record asks you to unlock.</p>

    <p>Questions about purchases? <a href="/support.html">See Support</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
